Limnoria plugins shipped with the Docker image, available in the container
at /opt/limnoria/plugins:

Currency  currency conversion (Frankfurter.app, optionally Alpha Vantage)
DevNull   assorted commands of the dev_null bot
MegaHAL   Markov chain chatting bot (megahal3 package)
Weather   current weather (Nominatim + MET Norway)

See the README.txt of each plugin.
